{"version":1,"key":"card:695","content":{"id":695,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"864a6f29-ed0c-4630-bd9e-4b499eb6f8f1","children":[{"type":"content-link","refId":694,"contentId":5598,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"6f041607-4c03-4e29-a6f1-ee78b3d96be6","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"overrides"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":581,"contentId":1438,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"286b1036-9ba4-48a5-b6d3-f46dae44acdb","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resolutions"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的对比。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4ea3a1a6-d9cd-43c0-b287-07257cddcd73","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其二者的功能是一样的，都是用来解决间接依赖版本控制的问题。考虑这么一个场景，当你的直接依赖 A 引入了有 bug 或安全漏洞的间接依赖 B，而你是没有办法去修改 B 的版本的，要么只能等待上游更新，要么自己 fork 一份代码自己去改依赖。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a87503c1-2ca6-47cd-98ad-8422bfd13bbd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了解决这个痛点，在 2017 年 Yarn 1.x 引入了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resolutions"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 字段，可以用来直接修改覆盖间接依赖的版本，它通过路径的方式来指定要覆盖的依赖"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","uuid":"2ab269cc-b723-4ac8-a9b8-70c376ba4318","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"bb33f794-5153-40ff-9d04-3683a6183c46","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n  \"resolutions\": {\n    \"foo/bar/lodash\": \"4.17.21\"\n  }\n}","collabId":"1c976f4a-c833-4209-9a74-42dd51a49a1a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f16b983b-a657-455b-9d9a-aafdc4204813","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pnpm 早期为了降低从 yarn 迁移项目的成本，也支持 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resolutions"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 字段。但对于 pnpm 来说，它自己的依赖结构是图谱式的，但 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resolutions"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 兼容语法是扁平路径式的，要用路径语法去匹配图谱结构，中间转一层不说，某些边缘场景（比如同一个包被多处引用、嵌套层级复杂时）还容易产生歧义。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"68b644aa-d0ca-44eb-a08e-a7d48d3f06d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"于是 pnpm 决定搞一套符合自己底层逻辑的方案，在自己的专属配置对象下发明了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"pnpm.overrides"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 字段，引入了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"foo>bar"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这种基于图谱依赖关系的新语法，类似于 CSS 选择器的风格。这种结构化的描述方式与 pnpm 的底层设计天然契合，不存在路径解析的代价。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","uuid":"d25a4c30-f12e-410f-816b-e8fe89233a45","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2b34c543-ce75-4a7f-b054-9f1447e4d88c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"foo>bar>lodash\": \"4.17.21\"\n    }\n  }\n}","collabId":"ec733a1c-92b1-4d09-a615-11f2b60d7b6d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b3c1d181-5869-4dae-a70d-a9cf7cb09b65","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也可以统一写在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"pnpm-workspace.yaml"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，让整个 workspace 共享同一套覆盖规则，维护起来更集中。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"YAML","uuid":"8751df75-4eda-4763-a8e5-7ee34974c6c5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"36bc2fad-b7e9-4156-aed4-a9e2b335cee7","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"packages:\n  - 'packages/*'\noverrides:\n  foo>bar>lodash: 4.17.21","collabId":"d325f71c-3da1-47c7-89a0-565073adee46","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"70f02b20-5159-484e-9800-84e90d0e5432","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"npm 作为老大哥，在很长一段时间里都拒绝引入类似 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resolutions"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的功能。官方认为强行篡改依赖版本违背了语义化版本控制的契约精神，是不安全的。但终究架不住社区呼声太高，npm 终于在 2021 年底的 v8.3.0 版本中正式加入了该功能。不过 npm 并没有沿用 Yarn 的名字，而是自己定义了一个全新的根级别字段，就叫 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"overrides"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，语法风格借鉴的也是 pnpm 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":">"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示法，而非 Yarn 的路径风格。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSON","uuid":"ea462594-3677-43b8-9d8f-d45996763133","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"12dfc3d4-017f-436d-b49c-7d567d5db628","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"{\n  \"overrides\": {\n    \"foo>bar>lodash\": \"4.17.21\"\n  }\n}","collabId":"3b23ed47-1bd5-408a-8c6c-0a5bd5ee2a41","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"highlight-block","calloutType":"note","title":"","color":"blue","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"5fae885c-e9c0-437a-ab17-c56b9e10a98a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ea0c46ec-bad1-47be-a23f-15438bae9a56","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"npm 和 pnpm 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"overrides"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不同的是，npm 的 overrides 字段是直接写在最外层的，而 pnpm 的 overrides 字段是写在其 pnpm 字段对象中的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b68783e0-c734-4384-b438-dea99b430735","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外 pnpm 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"overrides"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还可以写在 pnpm-workspace.yaml 中，可以对 monorepo 中的所有 workspace 生效，而 npm 仅限于当前项目。"}]}]}],"tags":["包管理器/npm","包管理器/pnpm","包管理器/package.json"],"createTime":1775617265463,"updateTime":1778134042126,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1778134042126},"links":{"card:694":{"key":"card:694","type":"card","id":694},"card:581":{"key":"card:581","type":"card","id":581}}}